# Frontend conventions

- Spec and `docs/flows/` beat leftover prototype copy.
- Public lists come from the catalog API, not a second hardcoded inventory, once Catalog is wired.
- No unverified price, rating, review count, guest favourite, or out-of-geo destination.
- URL holds non-personal filter state only.
- Async CTAs disable duplicate submits and keep the button visible.
- Sticky CTAs must not cover content or the keyboard.
- Payment return pages may show Processing — they must never set paid.
